<title>THAILAND: Thai rice vessels loading and movements.</title>
<headline>Thai rice vessels loading and movements.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai Commerce Ministry detailed rice loading at Thai ports as follows (in tonnes)</p>
<p> Vessel		Date of Arrival   Quantity     Destination</p>
<p> Lugoj		 29/10/96		8,000	Syria</p>
<p> Asian Progress    01/11/96	     11,000	Nigeria</p>
<p> Ashakruea	   04/11/96		6,000	Malaysia</p>
<p> Dinitrakif	  06/11/96		5,000	Africa</p>
<p> Sangthai Eagle    07/11/96		N/A	  Hong Kong</p>
<p> Sangthai Glory    07/11/96		N/A	  Singapore</p>
<p> Sortume Navigator 07/11/96		5,000	China</p>
<p> Vinh Thoub	  11/11/96		N/A	  China</p>
<p> Silver Sua	  11/11/96		4,200	China</p>
<p> Hamilton	    11/11/96	     10,000	Africa</p>
<p> Dibena Express    13/11/96		5,000	India</p>
<p> Cabot Orient	13/11/96		2,900	China</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
